","definition":"同意对方说的话时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["음"]},{"id":"112d19723c425ab6","term":"역시","zh":"果然","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3","entryId":"67372","definition":"和所想的一样。","pronunciation":["역씨"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我，我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"bdf42c88043159b8","term":"밥맛","zh":"饭味","audio":"/audio/bdf42c88043159b83c5e.mp3","entryId":"57646","definition":"饭的味道。","pronunciation":["밤맏"]},{"id":"97b8be84b3d009c4","term":"최고","zh":"最；最佳","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3","entryId":"47976","definition":"最好或最出色的。","pronunciation":["최ː고","췌ː고"]}],"audio":"/audio/2b37f5010e25fdda4e2e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57646-1-7-2","ko":"천천히 많이 먹어.","zh":"慢慢吃，多吃点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"천천히","meaning":"慢慢地，缓慢地","explanation":"천천히：慢慢地，缓慢地","readings":[{"term":"천천히","audio":"/audio/71c0b7db98a074453c87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26902","senseId":"1","lemma":"천천히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"71c0b7db98a07445","term":"천천히","zh":"慢慢地，缓慢地","audio":"/audio/71c0b7db98a074453